{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master of Balance is a text-driven workplace survival adventure game where you'll take on the role of a junior executive at a gaming company who, after being caught up in a strange magical incident, he must discreetly handle the business of daily life and work while investigating the truth behind what's going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of daily random events, Carefully balance the values of the five dimensions of boss, subordinates, family, health, and money by choosing different responses, every choice may reverse the situation in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/bb6846230f627fce8bdda3423e465480.poster.avif?t=1771305448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/bb6846230f627fce8bdda3423e465480.webm?t=1771305448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/bb6846230f627fce8bdda3423e465480.mp4?t=1771305448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Storylines\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy and witty main plot with different endings for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/c983222500a44804c7b0131352ae8275.poster.avif?t=1771305448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/c983222500a44804c7b0131352ae8275.webm?t=1771305448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/c983222500a44804c7b0131352ae8275.mp4?t=1771305448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and addictive mini-game that can be played with just the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/75a17767c3b84587dd682d02c90ecba7.poster.avif?t=1771305448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/75a17767c3b84587dd682d02c90ecba7.webm?t=1771305448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/75a17767c3b84587dd682d02c90ecba7.mp4?t=1771305448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical Abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of special abilities, free to mix and match, play in your own style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/edcf4df62108d7d2b61a2517983c331d.poster.avif?t=1771305448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/edcf4df62108d7d2b61a2517983c331d.webm?t=1771305448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/edcf4df62108d7d2b61a2517983c331d.mp4?t=1771305448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583940?t=1771305448","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583940?t=1771305448","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/46079291b7fe6cd4a91303507fc2d1e9d7b1e33c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771305448","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/46079291b7fe6cd4a91303507fc2d1e9d7b1e33c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771305448","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3701850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>About us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more content updates and feedback, welcome to join the Discord group!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master of Balance is a text-driven workplace survival adventure game where you'll take on the role of a junior executive at a gaming company who, after being caught up in a strange magical incident, he must discreetly handle the business of daily life and work while investigating the truth behind what's going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of daily random events, Carefully balance the values of the five dimensions of boss, subordinates, family, health, and money by choosing different responses, every choice may reverse the situation in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/bb6846230f627fce8bdda3423e465480.poster.avif?t=1771305448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/bb6846230f627fce8bdda3423e465480.webm?t=1771305448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/bb6846230f627fce8bdda3423e465480.mp4?t=1771305448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Storylines\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy and witty main plot with different endings for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/c983222500a44804c7b0131352ae8275.poster.avif?t=1771305448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/c983222500a44804c7b0131352ae8275.webm?t=1771305448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/c983222500a44804c7b0131352ae8275.mp4?t=1771305448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and addictive mini-game that can be played with just the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/75a17767c3b84587dd682d02c90ecba7.poster.avif?t=1771305448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/75a17767c3b84587dd682d02c90ecba7.webm?t=1771305448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/75a17767c3b84587dd682d02c90ecba7.mp4?t=1771305448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical Abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of special abilities, free to mix and match, play in your own style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/edcf4df62108d7d2b61a2517983c331d.poster.avif?t=1771305448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/edcf4df62108d7d2b61a2517983c331d.webm?t=1771305448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/extras/edcf4df62108d7d2b61a2517983c331d.mp4?t=1771305448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["NiniNana Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583940/b9ce47b864c536bef43491f448dc78ba0542f790/header.jpg?t=1771305448","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3583940/873611/5d511711c9de3df360400486d1ecbd66eeb7047f/1750461259/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745128471","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3583940/873611/5d511711c9de3df360400486d1ecbd66eeb7047f/1750461259/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745128471","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3583940/873611